  "Specification": "A scheduling-based resource allocator that maintains a priority schedule of clients. Clients request resource sets, the allocator schedules and allocates respecting priority ordering, and clients return resources. Proves mutual exclusion, an allocator invariant relating schedule order to resource availability, and liveness properties including eventual satisfaction.",
